5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's start carefully. Since it's the first day, we don't have much information.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I'm not sure what to say yet.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,We should observe everyone's speech patterns. The werewolf and possessed will likely try to blend in.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Logical. We need to identify contradictions. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in the claims.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit nerve-wracking, isn't it? Let's all try to get along and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Daisuke, you seem very nervous. Is there anything on your mind?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"No, I'm just... not used to this. I'm sorry.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Nervousness can be a mask, but it can also be natural. We can't judge based on that alone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Emotional states are unreliable indicators.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,Let's be kind to Daisuke. We're all in this together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,Does anyone have a strategy for the first vote tomorrow?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
