18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be looking for who is trying to lead the conversation too aggressively.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll just listen and try to support the group's consensus.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
