31,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. Asuka, you were very analytical yesterday. Do you have any leads?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we don't make a mistake.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have a very strong lead. Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a bold claim to make so early. Do you have proof, or are you the Seer?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh! Asuka, are you saying you're the Seer? That's a big revelation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Asuka is the Seer, the game could end today. But we must be sure she isn't the werewolf lying.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Asuka... are you really the Seer?,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Yes, I am. I divined Ryuji last night, and the result was werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It's a classic play to claim Seer and point at someone. I am a villager. Asuka is lying to secure an early win.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's hard to know who to believe. Ryuji seems so calm, but Asuka is usually very logical.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, if you're a villager, why are you so dismissive of Asuka's claim?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Asuka is telling the truth. She doesn't seem like she's lying.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Ryuji's dismissal is exactly what I expected from a werewolf trying to survive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply using reason. A werewolf claiming Seer is the most efficient way to eliminate a target.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. But if we execute a villager, we lose a precious ally.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I trust Asuka's logic more than Ryuji's denial. I'll vote for Ryuji.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll follow Asuka. I'm sorry, Ryuji.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is clear. Vote Ryuji.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,You are making a grave mistake.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go with the majority to keep the peace. I'll vote Ryuji.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
